        </div>


        <div class="accordion-container container">


            <!-- FAQ 1 -->
            <div class="accordion-item">

                <div class="accordion-header">

                    <h2 class="accordion-title">
                        How much does it cost to rent a car
                    </h2>

                    <i class="bx bx-plus accordion-icon"></i>

                </div>

                <div class="accordion-content">

                    <p class="accordion-answer">
                        Rental prices very based on car type duration and season.
                        Our rates start from $49/day for compact cars and go up
                        to $299/day for luxary vehicles. Weekly and montly
                        discounts are avaiable.
                    </p>

                </div>

            </div>



            <!-- FAQ 2 -->
            <div class="accordion-item">

                <div class="accordion-header">

                    <h2 class="accordion-title">
                        What do I need to rent a car
                    </h2>

                    <i class="bx bx-plus accordion-icon"></i>

                </div>

                <div class="accordion-content">

                    <p class="accordion-answer">
                        You need a valid driver license a credit card in your
                        name and proof of insurance. International renters may
                        need an International Driving Permit along with their
                        license.
                    </p>

                </div>

            </div>



            <!-- FAQ 3 -->
            <div class="accordion-item">

                <div class="accordion-header">

                    <h2 class="accordion-title">
                        Can I rent a car for someone else?
                    </h2>

                    <i class="bx bx-plus accordion-icon"></i>

                </div>

                <div class="accordion-content">

                    <p class="accordion-answer">
                        The person renting the car must be present at pickup
                        with their license and credit card; however, you can
                        add additional drivers to the rental agreement for
                        a small fee.
                    </p>

                </div>

            </div>



            <!-- FAQ 4 -->
            <div class="accordion-item">

                <div class="accordion-header">

                    <h2 class="accordion-title">
                        What is your cancellation policy?
                    </h2>

                    <i class="bx bx-plus accordion-icon"></i>

                </div>

                <div class="accordion-content">

                    <p class="accordion-answer">
                        Free cancellation up to 48 hours before pickup.
                        Cancellation within 48 hours may incur a fee.
                        No-shows are charged the full rental amount.
                    </p>

                </div>

            </div>



            <!-- FAQ 5 -->
            <div class="accordion-item">

                <div class="accordion-header">

                    <h2 class="accordion-title">
                        Is Insurance included in the rental?
                    </h2>

                    <i class="bx bx-plus accordion-icon"></i>

                </div>

                <div class="accordion-content">

                    <p class="accordion-answer">
                        Basic insurance is included in the rentals.
                        Additional coverage options like collision damage
                        and theft protection are available at checkout.
                    </p>

                </div>

            </div>



            <!-- FAQ 6 -->
            <div class="accordion-item">

                <div class="accordion-header">

                    <h2 class="accordion-title">
                        Can I return the car to a different location?
                    </h2>

                    <i class="bx bx-plus accordion-icon"></i>

                </div>

                <div class="accordion-content">

                    <p class="accordion-answer">
                        Yes, one-way rentals are available between most
                        locations. A one-way fee may apply depending on
                        the distance between pickup and drop-off locations.
                    </p>

                </div>

            </div>

        </div>

    </section>



